  "findings": [
    "Weighted traced recovery restores Hunodan hjfig-05 to 4+4 cuts and 5.27\u20135.35 seconds; the coverage-only grid/feature candidate had retained the slower 6+4 routing.",
    "The bird eye is retained, but total disagreement remains 2.096875%, above the unperturbed baseline 1.963125%; frame and connection defects remain.",
    "Seven of eight ignored-colour pairs have identical geometry. Puppy repeat 1 differs; initial count/fine-grid scores are identical, while timed refinement and detail histories diverge (32 versus 33 added curves, 125 versus 160 detail steps). This does not establish exact whole-solver colour invariance.",
    "All eight free-border control fits pass; both cases retain byte-identical geometry between runtimes and repeats. Protected errors are 0.1083374% house and 0.3417969% hat. Large whole-image differences are intentional border edits.",
    "The bauble remains a failure in both arms. Candidate observed error improves to 2.00\u20132.15% from 4.34\u20134.38%, but candidate geometry fails short-self-clearance and its paper result is uncertain. The earlier baseline is geometry/paper valid but fails image fidelity.",
    "Bauble initialization promotes a feature-weighted 4+6 spline with 32 control locations. Its initial geometry already has multiple clearance failures. It consumes the short refinement budget, and the ordinary 4+4 finalists remain queued without ever becoming retained legal candidates. The legal/image candidate sorter cannot help when no legal candidate was retained."
  ],
  "visualReview": {
    "artifacts": [
      "tmp/heart-learning/coverage-routing-comparison-v1/contact.png",
      "tmp/heart-learning/coverage-extended-v1/contact.png"
    ],
    "observations": "Hunodan border and main motif improve. Bird eye is visible again but small frame/gap defects remain. Puppy still has visible border deviations, including the left join. Free-border controls are unchanged. Bauble resemblance alone does not establish valid cutting templates."
  },
  "next": "Test retaining and refining an ordinary fallback before an initially illegal feature proposal consumes the remaining budget. Do not integrate this candidate until the wider legality regression is resolved.",
